HELM (Kubernetes Packaging & Release Scenarios)

These scenarios focus on real Helm failures, release issues, and production-safe deployments.

⸻

⎈ Helm – Real-World DevOps Scenarios
	1.	A Helm release failed during upgrade. How do you troubleshoot and recover?
	2.	Values work in dev but break in prod. How do you manage environment-specific configs?
	3.	A Helm chart upgrade caused downtime. How do you prevent this?
	4.	How do you roll back a failed Helm deployment safely?
	5.	A Helm release is stuck in pending-upgrade. What do you do?
	6.	How do you manage secrets securely with Helm?
	7.	How do you version and manage Helm charts across teams?
	8.	Helm templates are complex and hard to debug. How do you troubleshoot them?
	9.	How do you ensure zero-downtime deployments using Helm?
	10.	A Helm deployment succeeds, but pods are not created. How do you debug?
	11.	How do you integrate Helm with CI/CD pipelines?
	12.	How do you handle breaking changes in Helm chart upgrades?
	13.	A Helm chart uses deprecated Kubernetes APIs. How do you fix it?
	14.	How do you restrict who can install or upgrade Helm releases?
	15.	How do you audit Helm release history and changes?

